    "title": "Ragdoll Sandbox 3D",
    "description": "Ragdoll Sandbox 3D is a great place for creativity and fun, allowing players to explore the laws of physics and create unexpected situations in a fun and relaxed atmosphere.\r\n\r\n1. Real-time Physics: The game uses an advanced physics model, allowing dummies to interact with the environment, fall, collide and break according to realistic laws of physics.\r\n\r\n2. Intuitive Interface: Players can easily add, remove and modify dummies and various obstacles.\r\n\r\n3. Wide Range of Objects: The game features a variety of items and environments that can be used to experience different scenarios, from simple to complex, physically realistic challenges.\r\n\r\n4. Creativity: Players can create their own levels and scenarios by mixing and matching elements, allowing for unlimited creativity.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Ragdoll Sandbox 3D is a great place for creativity and fun, allowing players to explore the laws of physics and create unexpected situations in a fun and relaxed atmosphere.<br><br>1. Real-time Physics: The game uses an advanced physics model, allowing dummies to interact with the environment, fall, collide and break according to realistic laws of physics.<br><br>2. Intuitive Interface: Players can easily add, remove and modify dummies and various obstacles.<br><br>3. Wide Range of Objects: The game features a variety of items and environments that can be used to experience different scenarios, from simple to complex, physically realistic challenges.<br><br>4. Creativity: Players can create their own levels and scenarios by mixing and matching elements, allowing for unlimited creativity.",
